        "Abstract": "We present a new multi-domain wizard-of-oz (WOZ) dataset for building end-to-end task-oriented dialogue systems. The dataset, named MultiWOZ 2.1, contains 8780 dialogues in 6 domains (restaurants, hotels, attractions, trains, taxis, and hospitals) and 2 languages (English and Chinese). We introduce a new annotation scheme that allows for more fine-grained and consistent annotations. We also provide a set of baseline models and demonstrate that our dataset can be used to train state-of-the-art dialogue systems. We further analyze the characteristics of the dataset and discuss potential directions for future research."
